                                                "sense_id": "08f05499-c0f4-309c-96ee-fe3703a96b7d",
                                                "text": "1818, Benjamin Franklin, Memoirs, Philadelphia: T.S. Manning, Volume I, p. 73,\nI pitied poor Miss Read’s unfortunate situation, who was generally dejected, seldom cheerful, and avoided company […]"
